obj_id: agentGenerated_CentralRegionProfitPerformanceContributo-e2b4a018
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Central Region Profit Performance Contributors
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: fea25e75-9f24-452b-8abc-6a4adb74f758
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West Region leads with highest sales (725,458) and profit (108,418) at 14.9% margin
        • Central Region underperforms with lowest profit margin at 7.9% despite higher sales than South
        • Q4 months drive peak performance with Nov 2024 hitting 118,448 in sales
        • 48-month trend shows general upward sales trajectory from 2021-2024

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate Central Region cost structure and pricing to improve 7.9% profit margin
        • Replicate West Region strategies across other territories
        • Focus Q4 tactics year-round to boost off-season months
